{"id":"muskel","lemma":"Muskel","pos":"noun","rank":3264,"glosses":["muscle"],"ipa":"/ˈmʊskəl/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/5/58/De-Muskel.ogg/De-Muskel.ogg.mp3","gender":"m","forms":{"genitive":"Muskels","plural":"Muskeln"},"examples":[{"text":"Das Herz ist ein Muskel.","en":"The heart is a muscle.","words":[{"g":"the / that"},{"g":"heart"},{"g":"is","l":"sein"},{"g":"a"},null]},{"text":"Ihre Muskeln sind hart.","en":"Their muscles are stiff.","words":[{"g":"her","l":"ihr"},null,{"g":"are","l":"sein"},{"g":"hard"}]},{"text":"Mir tun alle Muskeln weh.","en":"All my muscles ache.","words":[{"g":"(to) me","l":"ich"},{"g":"to do"},{"g":"all, everyone"},null,{"g":"sore, painful"}]},{"text":"Die Katze bewegte keinen Muskel.","en":"The cat didn't move a muscle.","words":[{"g":"the"},{"g":"house cat"},{"g":"agitated, disturbed","l":"bewegt"},{"g":"no / not a","l":"kein"},null]},{"text":"Das heiße Bad entspannte meine Muskeln.","en":"The hot bath relaxed my muscles.","words":[{"g":"the / that"},{"g":"to have a name","l":"heißen"},{"g":"bath"},{"g":"to relax","l":"entspannen"},{"g":"my","l":"mein"},null]}]}